# Khoa API cua tro ly tu van, backend doc tu dong moi lan khoi dong.
#
# Cach dung:
#   1. Chep tep nay thanh tro-ly-ai.properties, dat cung thu muc backend.
#   2. Dan khoa API cua Anthropic vao dong app.assistant.llm.api-key ben duoi.
#   3. Khoi dong lai backend. Nhat ky khoi dong se bao "da bat AI".
#
# Tep tro-ly-ai.properties da nam trong .gitignore nen khoa khong bi day len git.
# Tuyet doi khong dan khoa vao tep .example nay vi tep nay nam trong git.
app.assistant.llm.api-key=

# Tuy chon: doi mo hinh hoac muc cong suc suy luan (low, medium, high)
# app.assistant.llm.model=claude-opus-5
# app.assistant.llm.effort=low
